{"id":"d740d724737a15d5","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-normal-subgroup.md","title":"Normal Subgroup","display":"df-normal-subgroup — Normal Subgroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-normal-subgroup","aliases":["58-df-normal-subgroup"],"display":"df-normal-subgroup — Normal Subgroup","depends_on":["[[58-df-subgroup]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-normal-subgroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-normal-subgroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-subgroup — Normal Subgroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,N,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,N,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}subgroup} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\exists e\\in G\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists h\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(g\\cdot h=e\\land h\\cdot g=e\\land\\{(g\\cdot n)\\cdot h\\mid n\\in N\\}=N\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}subgroup} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\exists e\\in G\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists h\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(g\\cdot h=e\\land h\\cdot g=e\\land\\{(g\\cdot n)\\cdot h\\mid n\\in N\\}=N\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witnesses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=g^{-1}\">\\(h=g^{-1}\\)</span> are bound inside the formula, so conjugation is interpreted using the displayed ambient operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-subgroup","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-subgroup]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)$（see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subgroup","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)$（see [[58-df-subgroup]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,N,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}subgroup} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(N,G,\\cdot)\\land\n\\exists e\\in G\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall x\\in G\\;(e\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot e=x)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists h\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(g\\cdot h=e\\land h\\cdot g=e\\land\\{(g\\cdot n)\\cdot h\\mid n\\in N\\}=N\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"h=g^{-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1102,"backlinks":[{"id":"d092bc2753a71d25","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormalSubgroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-normal-subgroup.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-885","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-normal-subgroup.md|58-df-normal-subgroup]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["59685d062adf2748","ed71f39f59370734"]}